{"seq":1,"slug":"the-zhuangzi-text","title":"The Zhuangzi Text","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zhuangzi/core-contributions/the-zhuangzi-text","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-literary-masterpiece","title":"文学的杰作","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zhuangzi/core-contributions/the-zhuangzi-text/a-literary-masterpiece","wordCount":1842,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"inner-outer-miscellaneous","title":"内外杂篇","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zhuangzi/core-contributions/the-zhuangzi-text/inner-outer-miscellaneous","wordCount":1759,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<p>本章呈现《庄子》一书的成就。它不仅是一部伟大的哲学著作，更是一部光彩夺目的文学杰作——以汪洋恣肆的想象、瑰丽奇特的寓言、浪漫飘逸的气质，开创了中国浪漫主义文学的源头。本章还考察了《庄子》内、外、杂篇的划分——内篇七篇最能代表庄子本人的思想，是全书的精华。本章揭示《庄子》作为思想与文学双重杰作的不朽价值。</p>\n"}